<title>UK: Merrill sets warrants on ML paper and pulp basket.</title>
<headline>Merrill sets warrants on ML paper and pulp basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co. has issued 750,000 call warrants on ML paper and pulp basket, lead manager Merrill Lynch International said.</p>
<p>The basket includes AssiDoman, MoDo, UPM-Kymmene and Stora.</p>
<p>One warrant refers to one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    100 DEM		   PREMIUM	10.13 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     =			   GEARING	9.87 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	28.NOV.97		 PAYDATE	20.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
